Replace StyleSheet.absoluteFillObject with StyleSheet.absoluteFill (src, lib/module, lib/commonjs).
React Native 0.86 removed absoluteFillObject; spreading undefined gives the sheet host container no size, so every sheet opens below the screen (LIVE-41010).
Same change as upstream https://github.com/gorhom/react-native-bottom-sheet/pull/2637, released in 5.2.9.
Not bumped yet: 5.2.9 changes its generic type defaults and @ledgerhq/lumen-ui-rnative 0.1.72 types derive from them (mobile typecheck fails).
Remove when @gorhom/bottom-sheet is bumped to >=5.2.9 (LIVE-41015).

